{"_id":"6a2fec722204ffbc59e5a1d6","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"icVUQgedEGcaPpJSV8JdI","description":"# Printing Variables\n\nPrinting variables is done with Python's built-in `print()` function. During analysis, printing intermediate values helps verify that transformations are working as expected. F-strings (`f\"value: {variable}\"`) provide a clean way to format output with variable values embedded in strings.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Variables in Python: Usage and Best Practices","url":"https://realpython.com/python-variables/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebef"},{"type":"article","title":"Python Print New Line: Methods, Examples, and Best Practices","url":"https://roadmap.sh/python/print-new-line","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf0"},{"type":"article","title":"Python Multiline Strings: The Complete Guide","url":"https://roadmap.sh/python/multiline-strings","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf1"},{"type":"video","title":"Data Types & Variables in Python","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLBlnK6fEyqRhN-sfWgCU1z_Qhakc1AGOn","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebf2"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:13:38.487Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/icVUQgedEGcaPpJSV8JdI.md"}